    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosiyaas Yerusaalemitti",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoof",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.35.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Faasiikaa ayyaanesse; hoolaan Faasiikaas guyyaa kudha afuraffaa jiʼa jalqabaatti qalame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis luboota hojii isaanii irratti muudee akka isaan mana qulqullummaa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.35.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.35.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "keessa tajaajilan isaan jajjabeesse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lewwota Israaʼeloota hunda barsiisanii fi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoof",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.35.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qulqullaaʼaniinis akkana jedhe; \"Taabota qulqullaaʼaa sana mana qulqullummaa kan Solomoon ilmi Daawit mooticha Israaʼel ijaare keessa kaaʼaa. Taabonni kun gatiittii keessanitti hin baatamin. Isin amma",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.35.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqa keessanii fi saba isaa Israaʼelin tajaajilaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akkuma qajeelfama Daawit mooticha Israaʼelii fi ilma isaa Solomooniin barreeffame sanaatti isin akkuma maatiiwwan keessaniitti garee gareedhaan of qopheessaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Kutaa maatiiwwan obboloota keessanii kanneen Lewwota hin taʼiniitiif gareen Lewwotaa tokko kutaa maatii tokkoo iddoo buʼaatii iddoo qulqulluu dhaabadhaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hoolaa Faasiikaa qalaa; of qulqulleessaatii obboloota keessaniifis xobbaallaawwan hoolaa qopheessaa; waan kanas akkuma",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.35.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "karaa Museetiin ajaje sanatti godhaa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosiyaasis hoolotaa fi reʼoota kuma soddomaa fi loon kuma sadii akka aarsaa Faasiikaa taʼaniif namoota achi turan hundaaf qabeenyuma isaa irraa ni kenne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qondaaltonni isaas uummataaf, lubootaa fi Lewwotaaf fedhiidhaan buusii kennan. Hilqiyaa, Zakkaariyaasii fi Yehiiʼeel bulchitoonni mana qulqullummaa Waaqaa aarsaa Faasiikaatiif hoolotaa fi reʼoota kuma lamaa dhibba jaʼaa fi loon dhibba sadii lubootatti kennan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konaneyaanis obboloota isaa Shemaaʼiyaa fi Naatnaaʼel wajjin, akkasumas Hashabiyaan, Yeʼiiʼeelii fi Yoozaabaad dura buutonni Lewwotaa sun hoolotaa fi reʼoota kuma shanii fi loon dhibba shan akka isaan aarsaa Faasiikaa taʼaniif Lewwotatti ni kennan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanni hundinuu qopheeffamnaan akkuma mootichi ajaje sanatti luboonni iddoo isaanii ijaajjan; Lewwonnis toora isaaniitiin ijaajjan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hoolonni Faasiikaa ni qalaman; luboonnis dhiiga itti kenname ni faffacaasan; Lewwonni immoo hoolota irraa gogaa ni baasan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaanis akka jarri akkuma Kitaaba Musee keessatti barreeffame sanatti",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoof",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.35.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.35.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dhiʼeessaniif kutaa maatiiwwan sabaatiif kennuudhaaf aarsaa gubamu kophaatti baasan. Loon illee akkasuma godhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akkuma ajajame sanattis hoolaa Faasiikaa ibiddaan waadan; aarsaa qulqulleeffame immoo okkoteetti, hubboo fi xuwweetti affeelanii yoosuma namoota hundaaf qoqqoodan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaanis ergasii sababii luboonni sanyiin Aroon hamma halkan walakkaatti aarsaa gubamuu fi cooma aarsaa dhiʼeessaa turaniif ofii isaaniitii fi lubootaaf qophii godhan. Akkasiin Lewwonni ofii isaaniitii fi luboota sanyii Aroon taʼaniif qopheessan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilmaan Asaaf faarfattoonni akkuma Daawit, Asaaf, Heemaanii fi Yeduutuun waa himaan mootichaa ajajan sana iddoodhuma isaaniif ramadame turan. Eegdonni karraa kanneen tokkoo tokkoo karraa irra turan immoo waan obboloota isaanii Lewwonni qophii isaaniif godhaniif iddoo isaaniitii deemuun hin barbaachifne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanaafuu tajaajilli",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.35.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.35.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hundinuu akkuma Yosiyaas Mootichi ajajetti ayyaana Faasiikaa ayyaanessuu fi iddoo aarsaa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.35.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.35.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "irratti aarsaa gubamu dhiʼeessuun guyyuma sana fiixaan baʼe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israaʼeloonni achi turanis yeruma sana Ayyaana Faasiikaa ayyaaneffatanii Ayyaana Maxinoo guyyaa torba ayyaaneffatan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bara Saamuʼeel raajichaatii as Israaʼel keessatti Faasiikaan takkumaa akkanatti hin ayyaaneffamne; mootota Israaʼel keessaas namni tokko iyyuu takkumaa akka Yosiyaas namicha luboota, Lewwotaa fi namoota Yihuudaa fi Israaʼel kanneen saba Yerusaalem wajjin turan sana hunda wajjin godhe sanaatti Faasiikaa akkasii hin ayyaaneffanne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Faasiikaan kun bara mootummaa Yosiyaas keessaa waggaa kudha saddeettaffaatti ayyaaneffame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosiyaas Duʼuu Isaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "ref",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "id": "2CH.35.20-2CH.36.1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35:20–36:1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwf –",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
